
Act as a Principal Full-Stack Engineer.

Implement a production-ready GitHub CI/CD integration for the KB Admin application so that Knowledge Base articles are automatically created and updated from GitHub repositories.

Objective

When a Pull Request is merged into the configured branch (main/master/develop), the Knowledge Base should automatically synchronize without requiring any manual import.

Requirements

## 1. GitHub Webhook

Implement a secure GitHub webhook endpoint.

Supported events:
- pull_request (closed)
- push
- workflow_run (optional)

Only process:
- merged pull requests
- successful pushes to tracked branches

Validate:
- X-Hub-Signature-256
- Webhook secret
- Repository
- Branch

Reject unauthorized requests.

--------------------------------------------------

